      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُكَّمٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْفَافٌ</span> [which means Camels' <i>feet,</i>
and <i>boots;</i> probably, here, the former: in the TK
it is expl. as meaning the <i>hoofs</i> of camels: and it
is there said that the sing. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاكِمٌ</span>]. (K.)

